Cell["\<\
Computations in xCoba perform intermediate simplifications, using the \
function stored in $CVSimplify.
Options are: FullSimplify (for the highest possible simplification), Simplify \
(default), Expand (less simplification) and Identity (no simplification).\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.910261321506174*^9, 3.91026139553081*^9}, {
